sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Authorize first, then sign a direct S3 request
accDescr: The application checks ownership and object existence before locally signing a URL. The client later requests the object directly from S3.
actor U as Signed-in user
participant A as EC2 application
participant M as IMDSv2
participant S as Private S3 bucket
U->>A: Request a PDF download
A->>A: Check user access to object
A->>M: SDK obtains role credentials
M-->>A: Temporary credentials
A->>S: HeadObject using role
S-->>A: Object metadata
A->>A: SDK signs a short-lived GET URL
A-->>U: Presigned URL
U->>S: GET using URL
S->>S: Evaluate signer permissions
S-->>U: PDF bytes
